It is derived from Domoticz_PiHole-Control by Wojtek Sawasciuk (Voyo),
https://github.com/voyo/Domoticz_PiHole-Control/ (Apache-2.0), which in turn
builds on the idea of an abandoned Pi-hole plugin by Xorfor,
https://forum.domoticz.com/viewtopic.php?t=20834.

Changes by Jan Reimen: HTTPS support with a private certificate authority,
Pi-hole v6 API, dynamic block list and group devices, and, as of 0.1.0, the
restructuring into the pihole_control package with tests and documentation.
